  evidencePrefab: {fileID: 6586202626002414144, guid: b02f6cf486235c440987b4f4073b828e, type: 3}
  storyName: N/A
  storyDate: N/A
  storyDescription: "My roommates and I use walkie talkies. We just thought it was
    a funny way to communicate around the house but last week one of their walkies
    went missing. We were just like \u201COh he lost it cause he\u2019s an idiot.\u201D
    and didn\u2019t think much of it after that. Over the next few weeks a voice
    started to come over the walkies. It kept saying \u201CGo down..\u201D and then
    it would garble into static. The house was also just straight up weird. We had
    issues where water pipes were bursting, the guy who came to fix it said that
    it looked like damage that would occur during a blizzard not the middle of fall.
    Some nights I would hear scrapes on my door like when a dog or cat wants in.
    The final thing was when my roommate found it downstairs. He thought he saw someone
    in the house. He said he saw a shadow in his peripheral always just a bit out
    of sight going around corners as he was following it. The walkie was going crazy
    yelling \u201CGO DOWN\u201D as he followed it to the basement. The shadow apparently
    stood in front of a shelf before dissipating. After moving it my friend found
    a door. Behind it was a skeleton with a walkie talkie on its chest. "
